beast and making it spit on the mark work?","nextNodeIds":[740640202]},{"nodeId":740640202,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5214,"speakerName":"Galvaryet","textMapHash":2708754706,"text":"Are you serious? Have you been under too much stress lately? Are you still mentally sound? Have you been scheduled for too many shifts?","nextNodeIds":[740640203]},{"nodeId":740640203,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21107,"speakerName":"Maupoil","textMapHash":3819328426,"text":"I'm absolutely fine. I just want to see a Blubberbeast spit.","nextNodeIds":[740640204]},{"nodeId":740640204,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5214,"speakerName":"Galvaryet","textMapHash":2091792850,"text":"You... need to take a day off.","nextNodeIds":[]}]},{"talkId":7406403,"talkConfig":{"checkActionAfter":false,"crowdLOD0List":[],"decoratorID":0,"disableTalkReview":false,"dontBlockDaily":false,"enableCameraDisplacement":false,"extraLoadMarkId":[],"finishExec":[{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"}],"forceNpcNotDestroy":false,"heroRuleId":0,"ignoreDragonTalkRule":false,"isEnableNoBlackInter":false,"linkBehaviorGrpId":0,"loadType":"TALK_NORMAL_QUEST","lockGameTime":false,"lowPriority":false,"newTalkFinishTime":false,"onlyQuestNpc":false,"participantId":[],"prePerformCfg":"","questIdleTalk":false,"randomTalkPos":0,"randomTalkPriorityList":[],"removeDuplicatedRandomTalk":false,"stayFreeStyle":false,"talkMarkHideList":[],"talkMarkType":"TALK_MARK_NONE","activeMode":"PLAY_MODE_HOST","beginCond":[{"param":["7406403","2","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"}],"beginCondComb":"LOGIC_NONE","beginWay":"TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL","heroTalk":"TALK_HERO_MAIN","id":7406403,"initDialog":740640301,"nextRandomTalks":[],"nextTalks":[],"npcId":[5252],"performCfg":"QuestDialogue/Q7406403","priority":5,"questId":74064,"showRandomTalkCount":0},"dialogs":[{"nodeId":740640301,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":3564395234,"text":"Huh? Isn't that Clynes?","nextNodeIds":[740640302,740640304]},{"nodeId":740640302,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":1769449346,"text":"Hello, Clynes. We meet again.","nextNodeIds":[740640303]},{"nodeId":740640303,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":294417866,"text":"Huh? If Clynes is here, then that mark must've been his doing, then.","nextNodeIds":[740640306]},{"nodeId":740640306,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5252,"speakerName":"Clynes","textMapHash":419552626,"text":"Huh? What are you two doing here...?","nextNodeIds":[740640307]},{"nodeId":740640307,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5252,"speakerName":"Clynes","textMapHash":2012640250,"text":"What are you talking about? I'm lost. Why don't you ask someone else?","nextNodeIds":[740640308,740640310]},{"nodeId":740640308,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":553480178,"text":"I think we've got the wrong guy, Paimon.","nextNodeIds":[740640309]},{"nodeId":740640309,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":845598186,"text":"#Oh, we got the wrong guy, did we... Wait! Don't let him deceive you, {NICKNAME}! There's no one else here, so it must be him!","nextNodeIds":[740640312]},{"nodeId":740640312,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5252,"speakerName":"Clynes","textMapHash":1961687634,"text":"...Alright, you win. I did it.","nextNodeIds":[740640313]},{"nodeId":740640313,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5252,"speakerName":"Clynes","textMapHash":1573664106,"text":"*sigh* I was planning to use this to catch up with some acquaintances, but I didn't expect that the two of you would be the ones to show up.","nextNodeIds":[740640314]},{"nodeId":740640314,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":503883170,"text":"Catch up with some acquaintances?","nextNodeIds":[740640315]},{"nodeId":740640315,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5252,"speakerName":"Clynes","textMapHash":1318498050,"text":"The Cipher Letter is a technology developed by Mr. Butor, and few know how to decode it, even at the Fontaine Research Institute. The only reason I know of it at all is because he was my benefactor.","nextNodeIds":[740640316]},{"nodeId":740640316,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5252,"speakerName":"Clynes","textMapHash":951798330,"text":"Unfortunately, he left us far too young, and management doesn't care for his Cipher Letter. So, I figured that if someone out there could decipher it, then we would have something to talk about.","nextNodeIds":[740640317]},{"nodeId":740640317,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5252,"speakerName":"Clynes","textMapHash":976275978,"text":"Oh, I don't mean that there's nothing to say between us, but there are many topics we do not have in common.","nextNodeIds":[740640318,740640321]},{"nodeId":740640318,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":1840818154,"text":"No need to force yourself, there really is nothing to say.","nextNodeIds":[740640319]},{"nodeId":740640319,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5252,"speakerName":"Clynes","textMapHash":1772554754,"text":"You're... very honest. I once had a friend who was as frank as you. They got into quite a bit of trouble because of it...","nextNodeIds":[740640320]},{"nodeId":740640320,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5252,"speakerName":"Clynes","textMapHash":3767263362,"text":"But looking back at it now, those really were happy times.","nextNodeIds":[740640325]},{"nodeId":740640325,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5252,"speakerName":"Clynes","textMapHash":3884232730,"text":"Anyway, is that the only reason you're here?","nextNodeIds":[740640326]},{"nodeId":740640326,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":972341682,"text":"Paimon almost forgot! Galvaryet and Maupoil asked us to investigate the culprit behind the graffiti.","nextNodeIds":[740640327]},{"nodeId":740640327,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":3266850626,"text":"Turn yourself in, please.","nextNodeIds":[740640328]},{"nodeId":740640328,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":2853402066,"text":"Turn yourself in! We won't show you any mercy if you resist arrest!","nextNodeIds":[740640329]},{"nodeId":740640329,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5252,"speakerName":"Clynes","textMapHash":958163666,"text":"*sigh*... Can't we just talk about this? Forget about Maupoil, I just don't want to fall into Galvaryet's clutches.","nextNodeIds":[740640330]},{"nodeId":740640330,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5252,"speakerName":"Clynes","textMapHash":2400586602,"text":"Would it be possible for you to, y'know, just turn a blind eye to this whole thing?","nextNodeIds":[740640331]},{"nodeId":740640331,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":573751746,"text":"But Maupoil said graffiti is prohibited in the Fortress! And breaking the rules is bad, isn't it?","nextNodeIds":[740640332]},{"nodeId":740640332,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5252,"speakerName":"Clynes","textMapHash":4127565586,"text":"If you're feeling a bit generous with definitions, then the Cipher Letters on the wall are no different from anything else posted there. They're decorations, nothing more.","nextNodeIds":[740640333]},{"nodeId":740640333,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5252,"speakerName":"Clynes","textMapHash":370173778,"text":"#How about I go with you, but {NICKNAME} can decide whether or not to turn me in?","nextNodeIds":[740640334]},{"nodeId":740640334,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5252,"speakerName":"Clynes","textMapHash":4020597506,"text":"Of course, if you choose to help me and save me from Galvaryet's clutches... I'd be willing to compensate you accordingly.","nextNodeIds":[740640335]},{"nodeId":740640335,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5252,"speakerName":"Clynes","textMapHash":13000994,"text":"I'm putting my fate in your hands. Let's head out now.","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":740640321,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":932197746,"text":"I'm so sorry about that.","nextNodeIds":[740640322]},{"nodeId":740640322,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5252,"speakerName":"Clynes","textMapHash":1082296010,"text":"Hah! When you say something like that, just how do you expect me to reply?","nextNodeIds":[740640323]},{"nodeId":740640323,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5252,"speakerName":"Clynes","textMapHash":1055618498,"text":"I know that at times like this, I should be polite and say something like \"it might be nice to hear about your adventures.\" But...","nextNodeIds":[740640324]},{"nodeId":740640324,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5252,"speakerName":"Clynes","textMapHash":2246076618,"text":"I've decided to be honest with myself — with this, anyway. I don't want to hear novel stories about the outside world. All I want to do is catch up with someone. So, I should be the one to apologize.","nextNodeIds":[740640325]},{"nodeId":740640310,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":453065850,"text":"Have a look around. See anyone else here besides you?","nextNodeIds":[740640311]},{"nodeId":740640311,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":4061322410,"text":"Yeah, that's right! Stop trying to trick us with your lousy acting!","nextNodeIds":[740640312]},{"nodeId":740640304,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":3990743210,"text":"'Fess up! You did it, right?","nextNodeIds":[740640305]},{"nodeId":740640305,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":3320102418,"text":"'Fess up! You're the one behind the graffiti, right?","nextNodeIds":[740640306]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7406403,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["5252"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}},{"subQuestId":7406404,"order":4,"stepDescription":"Talk to Galvaryet","stepDescTextMapHash":1231134172,"finishConds":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7406404,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["5214"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"},"isHidden":false,"talkIds":[7406404],"talks":[{"talkId":7406404,"talkConfig":{"checkActionAfter":false,"crowdLOD0List":[],"decoratorID":0,"disableTalkReview":false,"dontBlockDaily":false,"enableCameraDisplacement":false,"extraLoadMarkId":[],"finishExec":[{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"}],"forceNpcNotDestroy":false,"heroRuleId":0,"ignoreDragonTalkRule":false,"isEnableNoBlackInter":false,"linkBehaviorGrpId":0,"loadType":"TALK_NORMAL_QUEST","lockGameTime":false,"lowPriority":false,"newTalkFinishTime":false,"onlyQuestNpc":false,"participantId":[],"prePerformCfg":"","questIdleTalk":false,"randomTalkPos":0,"randomTalkPriorityList":[],"removeDuplicatedRandomTalk":false,"stayFreeStyle":false,"talkMarkHideList":[],"talkMarkType":"TALK_MARK_NONE","activeMode":"PLAY_MODE_HOST","beginCond":[{"param":["7406404","2","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"}],"beginCondComb":"LOGIC_NONE","beginWay":"TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL","heroTalk":"TALK_HERO_MAIN","id":7406404,"initDialog":740640401,"nextRandomTalks":[],"nextTalks":[],"npcId":[5214,21107],"performCfg":"QuestDialogue/Q7406404","priority":5,"questId":74064,"showRandomTalkCount":0},"dialogs":[{"nodeId":740640401,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5214,"speakerName":"Galvaryet","textMapHash":3500138434,"text":"I see you've found Clynes. But... Have you found the person responsible for the graffiti? Or at least any clues?","nextNodeIds":[740640402]},{"nodeId":740640402,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":757923298,"text":"Well, about that...","nextNodeIds":[740640403,740640413]},{"nodeId":740640403,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":53749466,"text":"It was Clynes.","nextNodeIds":[740640404]},{"nodeId":740640404,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5214,"speakerName":"Galvaryet","textMapHash":81924834,"text":"I thought so too.","nextNodeIds":[740640405]},{"nodeId":740640405,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5252,"speakerName":"Clynes","textMapHash":412704146,"text":"Ugh, and just like that, all the excuses I came up with are useless. I guess I'm just meat on the chopping block now, waiting to see how you'll dispose of me, huh?","nextNodeIds":[740640406]},{"nodeId":740640406,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":1690538170,"text":"Rules are rules.","nextNodeIds":[740640407]},{"nodeId":740640407,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21107,"speakerName":"Maupoil","textMapHash":3475090474,"text":"To be honest, I'm more concerned about how to remove this mark than any punishment you'll receive.","nextNodeIds":[740640408]},{"nodeId":740640408,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5252,"speakerName":"Clynes","textMapHash":865870026,"text":"You're interested in Cipher Letter technology? It will take quite a bit of time to explain, so why don't you sit down and listen?","nextNodeIds":[740640409]},{"nodeId":740640409,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21107,"speakerName":"Maupoil","textMapHash":3222076162,"text":"No, I'm not interested in the specifics. Just tell me how to remove it...","nextNodeIds":[740640410]},{"nodeId":740640410,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5252,"speakerName":"Clynes","textMapHash":278047754,"text":"Even that's a long story. After all, special paint and techniques are utilized...","nextNodeIds":[740640411]},{"nodeId":740640411,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21107,"speakerName":"Maupoil","textMapHash":1198895786,"text":"I have other work to attend to, so keep it short. Uh... Please...","nextNodeIds":[740640412]},{"nodeId":740640412,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5214,"speakerName":"Galvaryet","textMapHash":2167685986,"text":"#Let's leave them to it. {NICKNAME} and Paimon, here's the compensation you were promised. Thank you for your help.","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":740640413,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2654196234,"text":"This requires a professional. Clynes, have a look.","nextNodeIds":[740640414]},{"nodeId":740640414,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5214,"speakerName":"Galvaryet","textMapHash":2919996002,"text":"Clynes, is this the special mark you mentioned before?","nextNodeIds":[740640415]},{"nodeId":740640415,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5252,"speakerName":"Clynes","textMapHash":2219024570,"text":"Let me see... Hmm... Oh... Doesn't it look a lot like a gear? Where else could such a huge gear come from, except the Fontaine Research Institute?","nextNodeIds":[740640416]},{"nodeId":740640416,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5214,"speakerName":"Galvaryet","textMapHash":2801829090,"text":"It's from the Institute... and so are you. I'd say the link between the two is pretty obvious. Just admit it. You're the culprit, aren't you?","nextNodeIds":[740640417]},{"nodeId":740640417,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5252,"speakerName":"Clynes","textMapHash":2296933802,"text":"You can't say it like that! If, one day, I should be fortunate enough to dine with Galvana at Hotel Debord...","nextNodeIds":[740640418]},{"nodeId":740640418,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5214,"speakerName":"Galvaryet","textMapHash":3611333946,"text":"If you're still in dreamland, I can help you wake up. And if you think my punches aren't strong enough, I'm sure Roussimoff would be willing to lend a hand or three.","nextNodeIds":[740640419]},{"nodeId":740640419,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5252,"speakerName":"Clynes","textMapHash":396917362,"text":"Calm down, I'm only giving you an example! It's just an example!","nextNodeIds":[740640420]},{"nodeId":740640420,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5252,"speakerName":"Clynes","textMapHash":3618023106,"text":"Where was I... *ahem* Anyway, if Galvana and I were to go out together, though we're both from the Fortress, that doesn't mean that there is any connection between us.","nextNodeIds":[740640421]},{"nodeId":740640421,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5252,"speakerName":"Clynes","textMapHash":1502714250,"text":"See? There's no connection whatsoever! There's no link between me and this mark, just like there's no link between me and Galvana.","nextNodeIds":[740640422]},{"nodeId":740640422,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5214,"speakerName":"Galvaryet","textMapHash":2976508266,"text":"Fine, you've convinced me. But only about the relationship between you and Sis.","nextNodeIds":[740640423]},{"nodeId":740640423,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2059959770,"text":"Doesn't that mean he hasn't convinced you at all?","nextNodeIds":[740640424]},{"nodeId":740640424,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":2190963898,"text":"W—Well, we've got nothing else to say about this. It's up to you guys now!","nextNodeIds":[740640425]},{"nodeId":740640425,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5252,"speakerName":"Clynes","textMapHash":4196269098,"text":"Well, no matter what, I owe you my thanks. And the compensation you were promised...","nextNodeIds":[740640426]},{"nodeId":740640426,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21107,"speakerName":"Maupoil","textMapHash":158864266,"text":"#Right! {NICKNAME} and Paimon! I almost forgot your compensation! Although it's a pity you couldn't locate the culprit...","nextNodeIds":[740640427]},{"nodeId":740640427,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21107,"speakerName":"Maupoil","textMapHash":4119346194,"text":"But I'm sure Clynes will have a way to remove the mark! I'll leave the rest to him and Galvaryet, then. In the meantime, I have other work to attend to.","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7406404,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[{"LNHLPKELCAL":["133408084","0"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_UNREGISTER_DYNAMIC_GROUP"},{"LNHLPKELCAL":["3","133408017"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_NOTIFY_GROUP_LUA"},{"LNHLPKELCAL":["74025","1"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_INC_QUEST_GLOBAL_VAR"}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["5214"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}}],"unmappedTalks":[{"talkId":7406405,"talkConfig":{"checkActionAfter":false,"crowdLOD0List":[],"decoratorID":0,"disableTalkReview":false,"dontBlockDaily":false,"enableCameraDisplacement":false,"extraLoadMarkId":[],"finishExec":[{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"}],"forceNpcNotDestroy":false,"heroRuleId":0,"ignoreDragonTalkRule":false,"isEnableNoBlackInter":false,"linkBehaviorGrpId":0,"loadType":"TALK_NORMAL_QUEST","lockGameTime":false,"lowPriority":false,"newTalkFinishTime":false,"onlyQuestNpc":false,"participantId":[],"prePerformCfg":"","questIdleTalk":t